fixture zone1_03_control_short_chain
doc Control for room 03 (BUILD.md s5 tech 3, s15 "a 10-bounce chain"): the route's first six bounces and then no more down-strikes: the chain has to go on all the way, the spikes are 3008 u wide
room zone1/03_pogo_chain
spawn 74 608
frames 200
input
  0..5 R
  6..8 R jump
  9..39 R
  40 R dash
  41..44 R
  45..47 R jump
  48..54 R
  55 R D attack
  56..67 R
  68 R D attack
  69..80 R
  81 R D attack
  82..93 R
  94 R D attack
  95..106 R
  107 R D attack
  108..119 R
  120 R D attack
  121..199 R
end
expect
  at 122 event.pogo=1 vx=5120
  never 123..199 event.pogo=1
  # Falls into the spikes 9 frames after the last bounce, well short of the tunnel's end (3584 u).
  mark hazard 123..199 event.hazard=1
  at hazard x<3000u
end
